menu "BLE setup"

    config BLE_SETUP_BODY_MAX
        int "Largest settings body (bytes)"
        default 2048
        range 512 4096
        help
            The staged settings body (several writes) and the settings read
            are cut off at this size; a longer staged body is refused. Match
            the portal's PORTAL_BODY_MAX so both accept the same forms.

    config BLE_SETUP_ADV_INTERVAL_MS
        int "Advertising interval (ms)"
        default 160
        range 20 10240
        help
            Shorter is found faster by a phone and uses more airtime, which
            WiFi shares.

endmenu
